English

This distribution includes the number-reading classifier
`g2p_ko/data/number_reading_model.json`. It was trained from version 1.1
(2023-06-28) of AI-Hub dataset 159, "숫자가 포함된 패턴 발화 데이터". The
dataset was built with funding from the Ministry of Science and ICT and support
from the National Information Society Agency (NIA), Republic of Korea.

Dataset information:
https://www.aihub.or.kr/aihubdata/data/view.do?aihubDataSe=data&dataSetSn=484

AI-Hub usage policy:
https://www.aihub.or.kr/intrcn/guid/usagepolicy.do?currMenu=151&topMenu=105

AI-Hub FAQ:
https://www.aihub.or.kr/aihubnews/faq/list.do

The distributed file contains only trained coefficients, feature names, and
model metadata. AI-Hub source texts, spoken forms, labels, audio, speaker
metadata, split files, and training feature rows are not included in the
repository or distribution. Model structure and generation details are recorded
in `docs/NUMBER_READING_MODEL.md`.

AI-Hub permits distribution and use of models and services developed from its
data and requires attribution of the dataset and AI-Hub. Rights and terms for
the source dataset remain governed by the AI-Hub usage policy; this repository's
MIT License does not relicense the source dataset.

When redistributing a g2p-ko distribution containing
`number_reading_model.json`, preserve both LICENSE and this NOTICE.

The runtime dependency `kiwipiepy` and related language models are installed as
separate distributions and are not bundled in the g2p-ko wheel. Each separate
distribution remains subject to its own license and notices.
